[
  // The main road (doc 02 §9, FR-8), one quest at a time, in order.
  //
  // First the training in Ember Hollow (2026-09-27, at your call): one small quest for each thing
  // the game expects the player to know, done inside the village. Its gates stay barred until
  // the last one is done, so nobody walks out without having spent their points, learned a
  // skill, used the smith, the merchant, the flask and the shrine.
  //
  // Then three quests for every map (2026-09-27, at your call): a hunt, a stone, and the map's
  // boss. The boss quest is what opens the road to the next map (see the exits in
  // zones/act1.json).
  //
  // Rewards follow the chain formulas: xp = 140 · band^1.85 and yang = 260 · band^1.25 for each
  // map, split 30 / 30 / 40 between its hunt, its stone and its boss. The pacing simulation
  // counts one such share per map, so the three here must add up to it.

  // -- Training -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
